WEBVTT

00:10:56.071 --> 00:11:00.556
engineering, law, conferencing, translating videos.

00:11:00.556 --> 00:11:02.956
This is a ubiquitous tool.

00:11:02.956 --> 00:11:05.155
In order to break down our barriers,

00:11:05.155 --> 00:11:06.922
we have to learn to talk to people,

00:11:06.922 --> 00:11:10.922
to demand that people work on translation.

00:11:10.922 --> 00:11:13.272
We need it for our everyday life,

00:11:13.272 --> 00:11:16.106
in order to make the world a smaller place.

00:11:16.106 --> 00:11:17.806
Thank you very much.

00:11:17.806 --> 00:11:20.188
(Applause)